# Use Taskboard

When implementing, fixing, or changing this repo, track the work with the Taskboard CLI (`tb`, else `taskboard`, else `cargo run --quiet --bin taskboard --`). Always `--json --actor cursor`. Follow `AGENTS.md`.

Before the first edit:

```bash
$TB project list --json
$TB task list --project taskboard --json
$TB task create --project taskboard --title "..." --json   # if no matching TASK-n
$TB task move TASK-n in-progress --json
$TB run start TASK-n --agent cursor --json
```

Before the final reply: `run finish` or `run fail` that `RUN-n`. Then `task move` to `in-review` or `done`. `run finish` does not move the card.

Do not skip because the change is small or the user did not mention Taskboard. Questions with no edits may skip.
